# Python artifacts
# NOTE: bare `*.py` used to ignore ALL Python source, silently excluding
# project-owned tooling under server/scripts/ (e.g. the floor-area
# reconciliation audit, which encodes the authoritative room-dimension
# templates). Vendored skill scripts under .agents/ stay ignored.
